title: M6_CONVENIENCE_START
---
<<declare $m6_repeat_count = 0>>

M6 SMOKE — TECHNICAL / NON-CANON. This short line is the Auto timing baseline. #line:m6_short_01

M6 SMOKE — This substantially longer technical line deliberately contains enough additional words to make the configured Auto delay visibly longer than the preceding short baseline, without changing the M6 timing settings. #line:m6_long_01

<<vn_bg m3_bg_a>>
<<vn_clear_cg>>
<<vn_show m3_a default left>>

M3 A: M6 BACKLOG NAMED-01 — Open Backlog later to verify this speaker name and insertion order. #line:m6_backlog_named_01
M6 BACKLOG NARRATION-02 — This narration entry must have no speaker container. #line:m6_backlog_narration_02
M3 A: M6 BACKLOG NAMED-03 — This named entry must follow the narration without duplicate UI rows. #line:m6_backlog_named_03

M6 UNVOICED CONTROL — This line must remain unvoiced after the later voiced fixture. #line:m6_unvoiced_before_01
M3 A: M6 VOICE TEST — This new M6 line must play m6_voice_test.wav; Auto must wait for the voice to finish. #line:m6_voice_test
M6 UNVOICED CONTROL — No stale voice audio may continue on this following line. #line:m6_unvoiced_after_01

<<jump M6_CHECKPOINT_A>>
===

title: M6_CHECKPOINT_A
---
<<vn_checkpoint m6_checkpoint_a>>
M6 CHECKPOINT A — TECHNICAL / NON-CANON. Once the catalog entry is present, F1 Quick Save and F2 Quick Load are valid here. #line:m6_checkpoint_01
<<jump M6_REPEAT_LINE>>
===

title: M6_REPEAT_LINE
---
<<set $m6_repeat_count = $m6_repeat_count + 1>>
M6 TEST REPEAT OCCURRENCE {$m6_repeat_count} — This is the one authored source line that executes twice with stable ID m6_repeat_01. Read occurrence 1 manually; enable ReadOnly Skip while occurrence 2 is current. #line:m6_repeat_01
<<if $m6_repeat_count == 1>>
M6 TEST — Occurrence 1 is now read. Advance this instruction to re-enter the exact same authored repeat line. #line:m6_repeat_return_01
<<jump M6_REPEAT_LINE>>
<<else>>
<<jump M6_UNREAD_AFTER_REPEAT>>
<<endif>>
===

title: M6_UNREAD_AFTER_REPEAT
---
M6 TEST UNREAD STOP — This new unread line must display normally because ReadOnly Skip stops here. #line:m6_unread_after_repeat_01

M6 TEST CHOICE — Auto, Skip, and Next must not select either option. #line:m6_choice_prompt_01
-> M6 CHOICE A — Rejoin the smoke continuation. #line:m6_choice_a_01
    <<jump M6_CHOICE_CONTINUE>>
-> M6 CHOICE B — Rejoin the smoke continuation. #line:m6_choice_b_01
    <<jump M6_CHOICE_CONTINUE>>
===

title: M6_CHOICE_CONTINUE
---
M6 TRANSITION TEST — Advance to run the existing awaited M3 background crossfade. #line:m6_transition_intro_01
<<vn_bg_crossfade m3_bg_b 1>>
M6 TRANSITION COMPLETE — Background B must be visible before this line can appear. #line:m6_transition_complete_01

M6 SMOKE COMPLETE — TECHNICAL / NON-CANON. Visual Play Gate verification may now stop. #line:m6_end_01
===
